                "comment": "Professor Bartlett is a really great teacher! She is incredibly knowledgeable and clearly cares a lot about her students. My one issue with the class was that the syllabus was constantly changing and sometimes you didn't know which readings were due when. She would ultimately clarify and it was never a big deal. Easy A if you come to class!!!",
